  ("Load a soft wavetable in osc A, set 5 unison voices and adjust detune between wild (wide) and tight. Modulate wavetable position with an LFO synced to 4 bars in bipolar mode.","Wavetable osc + LFO","The timbre drifts slowly back and forth over 4 bars."),
  ("Turn on a low-pass filter and find the sweet spot where partials just peek out; put a random/chaos modulator on cutoff and lower its depth in the mod matrix.","Filter + random modulator","Gentle, non-repeating brightness motion."),
